@startuml SEQ_04_MENGAJUKAN_GANTI_JADWAL
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Mengajukan Ganti Jadwal

actor       "Asisten"                     as Asisten
boundary    "Browser"                     as Browser
control     "GantiJadwalPiketController"  as Controller
entity      "GantiJadwalPiket Model"      as Model
entity      "JadwalPiket Model"           as ModelJadwal
entity      "PeriodePiket Model"          as ModelPeriode

== Lihat Jadwal & Riwayat Permintaan ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Buka menu Ganti Jadwal Piket

Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/ganti-jadwal

Controller -> ModelPeriode : Query periode aktif
ModelPeriode --> Controller : Data periode aktif
Controller -> ModelJadwal  : Query jadwal asisten
ModelJadwal --> Controller : Data jadwal
Controller -> Model        : Query riwayat permintaan ganti jadwal
Model --> Controller       : Data riwayat
Controller --> Browser     : Render halaman ganti jadwal
Browser --> Asisten        : Tampil jadwal piket + form request + riwayat permintaan

== Submit Permintaan Ganti Jadwal ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Pilih jadwal, pilih hari baru, isi alasan, Submit

Browser -> Controller  : POST /piket/ganti-jadwal {jadwal_piket_id, hari_baru, alasan}

Controller -> ModelJadwal : Query jadwal piket
ModelJadwal --> Controller : Data jadwal
Controller -> ModelPeriode : Query periode aktif
ModelPeriode --> Controller : Data periode aktif
Controller -> Model : Cek apakah sudah ada request pending
Model --> Controller : Hasil cek
alt Sudah ada request pending
  Controller --> Browser : Pesan error sudah ada permintaan menunggu persetujuan
  Browser --> Asisten    : Tampil pesan error
else Belum ada
  Controller -> Model : create\n({jadwal_piket_id, hari_lama, hari_baru, alasan})
  Model --> Controller : Data permintaan baru
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
  Browser --> Asisten    : Permintaan berhasil dikirim, menunggu persetujuan admin
end

@enduml